		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>30-foot-tall skeleton formed from the spirits of mass starvation. Dribbles a stream of fractured bones from jaws.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 49, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d6) or bone breath, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bone Breath</strong>. Breathe a cloud of bone fragments in a near- sized cube extending from gashadokuro, CON 15+ or 3d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Consume Corpse</strong>. As an action, devour corpse within close. Regains 2d6 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
